<title>USA: Town &amp; Country delays 10Q filing.</title>
<headline>Town &amp; Country delays 10Q filing.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Town &amp; Country Corp said Wednesday it delayed the filing of its 10Q report for the second quarter ended August 25.</p>
<p>The company did not provide further details.</p>
<p>The company's stock was halted on the American Stock Exchange due to the news.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
